I have successfully implemented a fully interactive and visually stunning Google Developer Profile view directly integrated into the application, designed as a custom response to your profile URL request. Here is a summary of the design and functional updates:
🌟 High-Polish Design & User Interface
Visual Brand Integrity: Replicated Google's design system utilizing a beautiful multi-colored top banner (resembling Google colors), deep charcoal typography, elegant rounded container frames, spacious negative space, and custom icons.
Micro-Animations & Transitions: Leveraged motion transitions for smooth modal fade-ins, hover-scale reactions on cards, and tab-switching fade-in entries to keep the interaction feeling premium.
🛠️ Key Features & Interactivity
Durable Profile Header: Displays your name (César L. D.), professional headline, biography, location, and the unique ID handle 106442690294880135734 matching your request.
Statistics Bento Dashboard: Summarizes your developer progress instantly showing badges count, active XP level, completed learning paths, and global learning points.
Public Profile Sharing: Added a single-click "Compartir perfil" action that copies the real URL https://me.developers.google.com/u/106442690294880135734?authuser=1&pageId=none directly to your clipboard, triggering a sleek confirmation toast.
Dynamic Profile Customizer: Enabled full profile customization (changing name, title, biography, or location) which updates all states live and posts updates to your activity log.
Advanced Tabs Engine:
Insignias (Badges): Grid of earned badges (e.g., Gemini API Master, React 19 Architect, Firebase Cloud Pioneer). Clicking any badge triggers an immersive detail panel with completion dates, metadata, and an easy copyable social sharing trigger.
Rutas de Aprendizaje (Pathways): Visual progress-bar tracker for learning programs. Includes real-time progressive tracking so you can mock-complete modules or advance pathways dynamically.
Actividad Reciente: A chronological event log showing learning history and status updates.
Añadir Logros: A customizable playground panel where you can specify custom badge titles, pick tech categories (such as AI, Cloud, or Android), write criteria, and instantly register them on your profile, boosting your points count.
🔗 Seamless Platform Integration
Header Avatar & Community Hooks: Clicking on the top-right user profile avatar or the "Comunidad" button instantly transitions into the Developer Profile. Clicking on "Ayuda" or the back button returns you to the main Google Help center.
Popular Products Integration: Clicking on the popular product card "Cuenta de Google" also acts as a gateway, redirecting you directly to the profile view for a unified user experience.
